{"about_the_game":"<strong>Short Summary</strong><br>You have survived the unthinkable. A global apocalypse triggered by an experiment gone wrong called Project 9. Find out what happened and survive in this dangerous world. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756070/extras/c12b21c00e533c2b6399c1610e4d94ae.poster.avif?t=1740775771\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756070/extras/c12b21c00e533c2b6399c1610e4d94ae.webm?t=1740775771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756070/extras/c12b21c00e533c2b6399c1610e4d94ae.mp4?t=1740775771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>In this FPS you'll have a large variety of weapons to defend yourself against all threats. You'll get to know many inhabitants of this world. Some are friendly to you, some are less friendly. Always be ready to defend yourself.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756070/extras/2f3ecce26e046bbc8d3c1b84c36bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1740775771\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756070/extras/2f3ecce26e046bbc8d3c1b84c36bb2f6.webm?t=1740775771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756070/extras/2f3ecce26e046bbc8d3c1b84c36bb2f6.mp4?t=1740775771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>World</strong><br>There is much to discover in the world of &quot;Project 9&quot;. Besides dense forests and beautiful nature, there are small villages but also a big city to discover. Collect weapons and items to change the situation in your favor.<